

* --- Globally Hoisted Models for Multi-Subcircuit Visibility ---
.model nfet_06v0_bsim0 NMOS (VTO=0.7 KP=100u LAMBDA=0.02)
.model pfet_06v0_bsim0 PMOS (VTO=-0.7 KP=40u LAMBDA=0.02)

.subckt LM358B IN1_P IN1_N IN2_P IN2_N OUT1 OUT2 V_P V_N NC
* 1. DC Biasing and Current Mirrors
M1 IN1_P IN1_N V_P V_N nfet_06v0_bsim0 W=10u L=0.5u
M2 IN2_P IN2_N V_P V_N pfet_06v0_bsim0 W=10u L=0.5u
R1 V_P IN1_P 100k
R2 V_P IN2_P 100k
R3 IN1_P IN2_P 1k
R4 V_N IN1_N 100k
R5 V_N IN2_N 100k
R6 IN1_N IN2_N 1k
* 2. Differential Pair Active Biasing
Ibias1 V_P IN1_P 0 100u
Ibias2 V_P IN2_P 0 100u
* 3. First Stage Gain
X1 IN1_P IN1_N V_P V_N nfet_06v0_bsim0 W=10u L=0.5u pfet_06v0_bsim0 W=20u L=0.5u LM358B_stage1
* 4. Second Stage Gain with Miller Compensation
X2 OUT1 IN1_P IN1_N V_P V_N nfet_06v0_bsim0 W=10u L=0.5u pfet_06v0_bsim0 W=20u L=0.5u LM358B_stage2
Cc OUT1 OUT2 10p
Rz OUT1 OUT2 2k
* 5. Output Buffers
M3 OUT1 OUT2 V_P V_N nfet_06v0_bsim0 W=20u L=0.5u
M4 OUT2 OUT2 V_P V_N pfet_06v0_bsim0 W=20u L=0.5u
* 6. Explicit Device Models
.ends LM358B